        "Id2": {
            "text": "The currency of Mexico, where the local people are called Mexicans, is the peso and the name of the leader of Mexico is Silvano Aureoles Conejo. Bionico is a dessert which can be found in Guadalajara there and granola is one of the ingredients of this food."
        },
